# Project-level skills that ship with the repo so future maintainers get
# the same agentic recipes the author relied on. Git requires unignoring
# parent dirs before files; we then re-ignore everything under skills/
# and only un-ignore the specific skills meant to ship.
!.claude/skills
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/mcp-graph-release-monitor/
